1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,802
Here is the one line test that decides most slides.

2
00:00:03,802 --> 00:00:10,091
Xylem and phloem on the same radius, with cambium between them, means stem.

3
00:00:10,091 --> 00:00:12,526
On alternate radii means root.

4
00:00:12,526 --> 00:00:14,023
Decide that first.

5
00:00:14,023 --> 00:00:18,268
Then count the xylem groups to decide dicot or monocot.

